    "en": {
      "text": "Kills release a varying number of Submunitions on top of where the enemy died. 6? second cooldown between activations.\n\nThe number of Submunitions spawned is tied to <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\n• Minors: 1 Submunition\n• Elites and Players: 3 Submunitions\n• Minibosses and Bosses: 7 Submunitions\n\nSubmunitions:\n• Identical to <exotic Telesto /> Bolts in behavior, exploding on proximity or contact and last up to 10.5 seconds after attaching to a surface.\n• Deal up to <pve 39.5? /> <pvp [?] /> damage and inherit the weapon's <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] />.",
